## Where this project's knowledge lives

| What | Where |
|---|---|
| Accumulated brain (architecture, conventions, gotchas) | `{{VAULT}}/AIOS/Projects/{{SCOPE}}/{{PROJECT}}.md` |
| How I work in this scope, and what's confidential | `{{VAULT}}/AIOS/me-{{SCOPE}}.md` |
| Dated decision log | `{{VAULT}}/AIOS/History/Log.md` |

A `SessionStart` hook already reads the first two into context at the start of every interactive session, so **don't re-read them unprompted** — check whether they're already above before opening them.

This file exists for when that hook doesn't run: a subagent, a `claude -p` invocation, a different editor or tool. It tells you where the knowledge is even when nothing injected it.

## Rules for this repo

- **The vault is written through `/aios-log`, never by hand.** `/aios-log <fact>` captures a durable decision into `{{VAULT}}`, auto-detecting scope and project from the working directory. It never touches this repo.
- **Never copy vault content into this repo**, and never hand-edit vault notes from here. The `Stop` hook queues a session digest automatically; `/aios-ingest` compounds it later.
- A fact worth writing down is one you'd otherwise re-learn in three weeks. Everything else can wait for the digest.

